  {
    "name": "design_project_cad",
    "description": "Delegate a requested CAD drawing from the current selected Solution and its purpose-specific design intent. Resolve consequential choices through expert advice and supported selections before fixing construction geometry; reuse prior decisions and delegation. An exploratory form sketch may retain explicitly deferred choices within its stated scope. For a construction concept with parts, material revisions and typed joints, use save_construction_draft and check_construction_draft first; this drawing tool cannot replace that deliverable or repair catalog definitions. Selected original images accompany the same pinned intent for designer and reviewer. Intake returns remaining needs together; reuse existing Tasks/Steps or gather measurements in chat, then resume the same request_id. Returns a checked candidate, not a saved drawing. Specify coordinate/view directions and relevant object IDs; the assistant can fetch wider dependencies.",
    "parameters": {
